# sidecar
kz-plan-sidecar 1
generator tool=kz-static tool_sha256=<sha256> tool_source=<sha256> core_source=<sha256>
input facts sha256=<sha256> path=<path>
input framework-layer-data sha256=<sha256> path=<path>
facts-artifact <sha256>
rules plan rules revision 1 (2026-11-16); relations rules revision 6 (2026-11-16)
selection observation-set: every row of the relations (method document 3.1, the revised rule: no label and no proof of a row removes it)
priority method-priority: method priority port revision 1 (2026-11-16): label, order class, reach mark and disposition of the method document's S1 rule over the row text; tier 1 = disposition D07 (label R or J, counterpart, order class RELOC), tier 2 = the other rows of order class RELOC, tier 3 = the rest; within a tier the order of the relations text
classes rows 4 tier1 4 tier2 0 tier3 0
budget value=tier:D07 reason="the priority tier whole (test)" disclosure="none given" planned=4 truncation=0 rows cut (row lines with state cut) unresolved="none" sensitivity="not measured"
bound string KZ_RT_STR_MAX=64 source=runtime/include/kz_rt.h:82 reason="the runtime's copy bound; a key text is bounded by the program's own constant length check where the facts show one" truncation="the runtime flags a cut string per value"
bound slots=4 source=instrument/gcc/kzgcc.cpp build_obs reason="values per event bound by kzgcc 0.3"
bound sites<=4095 source=instrument/gcc/kzgcc.cpp plugin_init reason="the binding id scheme" sites=18
param tu-root - (units outside the bundle root are named relative to it)
param bundle-root -
